OL,3,AThe warning signs that you're getting
OL,4,Abad debt advice
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increasing number of people are
OL,7,Fmissing credit card repayments as
OL,8,Ffinances are stretched by rising bills,
OL,9,Faccording to the Bank of England.
OL,11,FLenders also told the Bank they
OL,12,Fexpected the number of unpaid credit
OL,13,Fcard debts to keep going up this
OL,14,Fautumn.
OL,16,FThis could lead to more demand for
OL,17,Fadvice on how to deal with debts ` but,
OL,18,Fif you are struggling and need help,
OL,19,Fthere are some traps to avoid.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
